Scope of this license

The MIT License above covers the original work in this project: the source
code (mod/ and tools/) and the textures drawn from scratch for CYBER//UI
(buttons, sliders, text fields, checkboxes, tabs, scroll bars, tooltips, slot
highlights, menu backgrounds and separators, the SYS//STAT panel, the hazard
strip and the pack icon).

It does NOT cover content derived from Minecraft. The following files are
re-coloured versions of original Minecraft textures and remain the property of
Mojang AB / Microsoft; they are distributed only as part of this resource pack
and mod, as permitted by the Minecraft Usage Guidelines
(https://www.minecraft.net/usage-guidelines):

  - container and inventory screens:  assets/minecraft/textures/gui/container/
  - recipe book and advancements:      assets/minecraft/textures/gui/recipe_book.png,
                                       assets/minecraft/textures/gui/advancements/,
                                       sprites under container/, recipe_book/, advancements/
  - the title logo and edition text:   assets/minecraft/textures/gui/title/*.png
  - the title screen panorama:         assets/minecraft/textures/gui/title/background/panorama_*.png,
                                       mod/src/main/resources/assets/cyberui/textures/gui/panorama/
  - the loading screen logo:           mod/src/main/resources/assets/cyberui/textures/gui/loading_logo.png

NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG
OR MICROSOFT.
